uct Requirement","Concept Design","Concept Selection","Detailed Design","CAD + Engineering"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Analysis","Prototype","Testing / Validation","Design Iteration","Design Freeze / Release","Manufacturing Handoff","Production / Field Feedback","Continuous Improvement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Prototyping"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain hands-on experience with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"CNC machining"},{"text":"Laser cutting"},{"text":"Sheet-metal fabrication"},{"text":"Basic electronics integration"},{"text":"Rapid prototyping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Proof-of-concept prototypes"},{"text":"Functional prototypes"},{"text":"Engineering prototypes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document every iteration."},{"type":"h","text":"Testing & Validation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Test planning"},{"text":"Test specifications"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Failure analysis"},{"text":"Validation"},{"text":"Verification"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible measurements:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Force"},{"text":"Torque"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Displacement"},{"text":"Strain"},{"text":"Speed"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering Instrumentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Load cells"},{"text":"Strain gauges"},{"text":"Thermocouples"},{"text":"Accelerometers"},{"text":"Pressure sensors"},{"text":"Displacement sensors"},{"text":"DAQ systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arduino"},{"text":"ESP32"},{"text":"Raspberry Pi"}]},{"type":"p","text":"for prototype data acquisition where appropriate."},{"type":"h","text":"Reliability Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"R&D designers need to understand why products fail."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Reliability prediction"},{"text":"Failure modes"},{"text":"Root Cause Analysis"},{"text":"Accelerated testing"},{"text":"Life testing"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Wear"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Common Failure Modes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Fracture"},{"text":"Wear"},{"text":"Corrosion"},{"text":"Thermal failure"},{"text":"Buckling"},{"text":"Excessive vibration"},{"text":"Joint failure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop professional documentation skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering drawings"},{"text":"Bill of Materials"},{"text":"Design specifications"},{"text":"Design calculations"},{"text":"Test reports"},{"text":"Validation reports"},{"text":"Change requests"},{"text":"Engineering change notices"},{"text":"Design review presentations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic PLM/PDM concepts."},{"type":"h","text":"Industry-Specific Standards"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on your target industry, learn the relevant standards and regulations."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ISO"},{"text":"ASME"},{"text":"ASTM"},{"text":"SAE"},{"text":"IEC"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For regulated sectors such as aerospace, automotive or medical devices, additional industry-specific requirements apply."},{"type":"p","text":"Do not treat standards as generic certificates; understand how they affect actual design decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"}]},{"heading":"Lightweight Mechanical Product","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Design and optimize a mechanical component using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"FEA"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Topology optimization"},{"text":"3D printing/CNC"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"h","text":"Original Design vs Optimized Design"},{"type":"p","text":"using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"